      "comment" : "Data settings: what the project document holds",
      "extractionState" : "stale",
      "localizations" : {
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Die Sendung: Voreinstellungen, Einstellungen, Ebenen und Audiokanäle."
          }
        },
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "El programa: preajustes, tomas, capas y canales de audio."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "This empties the %@ Tingra has recorded so far. New activity is still logged, so the next log you share covers only the problem you are reporting. This cannot be undone." : {
      "comment" : "Confirmation alert message before emptying the log file; the placeholder is its size",
      "localizations" : {
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Dadurch werden die bisher aufgezeichneten %@ gelöscht. Neue Aktivitäten werden weiter protokolliert, sodass das nächste geteilte Protokoll nur das gemeldete Problem umfasst. Dies kann nicht rückgängig gemacht werden."
          }
        },
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Esto vacía los %@ que Tingra ha registrado hasta ahora. La nueva actividad sigue registrándose, así que el próximo registro que comparta cubrirá solo el problema que está informando. Esto no se puede deshacer."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "This removes what Tingra has saved on this Mac, then quits. It cannot be undone." : {
      "comment" : "Confirmation alert message before removing all data: the opening line",
      "localizations" : {
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Dies entfernt, was Tingra auf diesem Mac gesichert hat, und beendet dann Tingra. Das lässt sich nicht rückgängig machen."
          }
        },
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Esto elimina lo que Tingra ha guardado en este Mac y luego sale. No se puede deshacer."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Tingra has stopped saving so nothing is written back. Quit Tingra, then remove what remains by hand." : {
      "comment" : "Data settings: footer under the kinds of data that could not be removed",
      "localizations" : {
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Tingra sichert nicht mehr, damit nichts zurückgeschrieben wird. Beende Tingra und entferne den Rest von Hand."
          }
        },
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Tingra ha dejado de guardar para que nada se vuelva a escribir. Sal de Tingra y elimina lo que queda a mano."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Tingra Log" : {
      "comment" : "Logging settings: the shared log file's title in the share picker",
      "localizations" : {
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Tingra-Protokoll"
          }
        },
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Registro de Tingra"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Tingra records what it does — every event on its event bus — to this file, in the format the command line's --log-file option writes. Console.app carries the same events in the system log." : {
      "comment" : "Logging settings: footer explaining what the log file is",
      "localizations" : {
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Tingra zeichnet in dieser Datei auf, was es tut – jedes Ereignis auf seinem Ereignisbus – im Format, das die Option --log-file der Befehlszeile schreibt. Die Konsole führt dieselben Ereignisse im Systemprotokoll."
          }
        },
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Tingra registra en este archivo lo que hace, cada evento de su bus de eventos, en el formato que escribe la opción --log-file de la línea de comandos. Consola muestra los mismos eventos en el registro del sistema."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Top" : {
